      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Ammonium sulfate is a chemical compound commonly used as a fertilizer to provide nitrogen and sulfur to soils. It is produced through a synthetic process combining ammonia and sulfuric acid. It may come in crystalline or granular form, is water-soluble, and its quality is regulated by international standards. Ammonium sulfate may be available to consumers in packaged form or to industrial users in bulk, and it is often used in agriculture.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "硫酸铵是一种常用的化肥，用于向土壤提供氮和硫。它是通过合成过程生产的，该过程结合了氨和硫酸。它可能以结晶形态或颗粒形态出现，且可溶于水，其质量受国际标准的规范。硫酸铵可能以包装形式提供给消费者，或以散装形式提供给工业用户，通常用于农业。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
